  "summary_insights": [
    "Revenue grew by 17.6% year-on-year, reaching £1.695m, indicating strong market demand for installation services.",
    "Gross margin remained exceptionally stable at 62.7%, suggesting consistent pricing and direct cost control despite higher volume.",
    "Operating profit fell by 55.3% due to a significant 34.9% increase in administrative expenses, which rose from £730k to £985k.",
    "Staff costs (excluding directors) increased by 47.2%, driven by headcount growth from 14 to 19 employees, significantly impacting the bottom line.",
    "Depreciation charges rose sharply from £10.8k to £51.9k following substantial investment in plant and machinery (£338k additions).",
    "Net profit margin compressed from 9.2% to 3.2%, reflecting a transition year where overhead investment outpaced revenue growth.",
    "Interest coverage ratio remains healthy at 11.4x, though it has declined from 38.2x due to lower earnings and higher interest costs.",
    "The company maintained a dividend policy, distributing £52.6k in 2024, which represents nearly 98% of the year's net profit."
